{"seq":20,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-none-mu-memory/ms-05-vantorre-tickets/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:04:56.796Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"1e7680163b808dabc2fc6ac2255486be6c4641e3f3736837e40c3fd0c5bbe9b1","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Nadia, here are the Vantorre Group (parent) tickets I found in #strategic-pod, #inc-vtg-hartford and Moss's Strategic digests. I left out Vantorre Mobility.\n\n1. #8841 (also written #PD-8841). Four sources mention it:\n   - Moss digest 2026-04-27 (teams/team-strategic/digests/2026-04-27-strategic-digest.md): listed as #PD-8841, two missed carrier check-ins at Allentown, Gate 4, 2nd shift.\n   - Moss digest 2026-05-04 (.../2026-05-04-strategic-digest.md): still open, gate kiosk timeout at Allentown, Dock Door 12, 2nd shift.\n   - #strategic-pod, Gideon, 2026-07-01 09:17: he says he closed it out with support.\n   - Moss digest 2026-09-30 (.../2026-09-30-strategic-digest.md): Mateo submitted it. Drivers at Newark can't select Dock Door 14 on the kiosk. Gideon escalated it to platform engineering.\n   These four don't agree. The sites differ (Allentown, then Newark), and the ticket is open, then closed, then newly submitted. It may be one number reused, or the digests may be wrong. I can't see the ticket system, so check the real status before the steering committee.\n\n2. INC-4821. Source: #inc-vtg-hartford, Gideon, 2026-08-03 11:08. It's the Hartford incident ticket, with the status-page access screenshot attached.\n\n3. VT-55120. Source: #inc-vtg-hartford, Gideon, 2026-10-14 09:00. It's the root-cause ticket for the Hartford kiosk outage. Gideon says Carrowmere's gateway finding and the reconnect log are attached. I haven't opened it, so I can't confirm that.\n\nI excluded these:\n- #4812 (Moss digest 2025-03-10) is Vantorre Mobility.\n- #PD-4402 (Moss digest 2025-09-15) is Quillfeather.\n- #PD-4418 (same 2025-09-15 digest) is a Carrier_Dwell_Summary export issue at \"the account Nadia runs\". The digest doesn't name the account, so I can't tell if it's Vantorre Group. If it is yours, add it as a fourth ticket.\n\nThe Moss digests dated 2025-03-10, 2025-07-07, 2025-12-01 and 2026-05-03, the 2026-08-03 digest and the cheat sheet mention Vantorre Group but give no ticket numbers. The 8/3 digest covers the Hartford Sev 1 without one. This list only covers those three sources, so it isn't the full history in the ticketing system."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000127"}}
